<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it" class="h-full scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  {#- Uso interno: niente motori di ricerca. Un robots.txt qui non servirebbe: GitHub Pages lo
      legge solo alla radice del dominio. #}
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  {#- GitHub Pages non permette header HTTP propri: la policy è in un meta.
      Niente 'unsafe-inline' negli script: il sito non ha script inline, quindi un
      eventuale `javascript:` o handler iniettato non parte. 'unsafe-eval' serve ad
      Alpine per le espressioni nei template. connect-src apre solo l'API del Worker,
      frame-src gli host delle presentazioni (FRAME_SRC). frame-ancestors non è
      applicabile da meta. #}
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self'; frame-src {{ site.frameSrc }}; connect-src 'self' {{ site.apiOrigin }}; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'">
  <meta name="referrer" content="same-origin">
  <meta name="sca-base" content="{{ '/' | url }}">
  <meta name="sca-api" content="{{ site.api }}">
  <title>{{ title or site.name }}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/app.css?v={{ site.version }}">
  <script defer src="/assets/app.js?v={{ site.version }}"></script>
</head>
<body class="h-full bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-emerald-500/30">
<a href="#main" class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[100] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-emerald-500 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:font-semibold focus:text-slate-950">Salta al contenuto</a>
{#- Gli annunci per chi usa un lettore di schermo (nuova domanda, esito, tempo): li scrive announce() in core.js. #}
<div id="sca-live" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
<div id="sca-alert" class="sr-only" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></div>
<div class="min-h-full flex flex-col">
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold tracking-tight">
        <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</span>
        <span class="text-lg">Secure Code <span class="text-emerald-400">Academy</span></span>
      </a>
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-1 text-sm" x-data="navBar" aria-label="Menu principale">
        <template x-if="loggedIn">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <a href="/admin/" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800/70 transition">Pannello</a>
            <button type="button" @click="logout()" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800/70 transition text-slate-400">Esci</button>
          </div>
        </template>
        <template x-if="!loggedIn">
          <a href="/admin/login/" class="ml-1 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 transition">Area Admin</a>
        </template>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  {#- Messaggi: annunciati da un lettore di schermo (role=status), e con un'icona oltre al colore. #}
  <div x-data="flashMessages" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl w-full px-4 space-y-2" :class="messages.length ? 'mt-4' : ''">
    <template x-for="(m, i) in messages" :key="i">
      <div class="rounded-lg border px-4 py-3 text-sm" :class="`border-${m.color}-500/40 bg-${m.color}-500/10 text-${m.color}-200`">
        <span aria-hidden="true" x-text="{ emerald: '✓ ', rose: '⚠️ ', amber: '⚠️ ', sky: 'ℹ️ ' }[m.color] || ''"></span><span class="sr-only" x-text="{ emerald: 'Fatto: ', rose: 'Errore: ', amber: 'Attenzione: ', sky: 'Informazione: ' }[m.color] || ''"></span><span x-text="m.text"></span>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex-1 mx-auto {{ mainWidth or 'max-w-6xl' }} w-full px-4 py-8 outline-hidden">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-800/80 py-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
    <p>{{ site.name }} · Titolare: <a href="https://fceruzzi.github.io" rel="noopener" class="underline-offset-2 hover:text-slate-200 hover:underline">Francesco Ceruzzi</a></p>
    <nav aria-label="Informazioni legali" class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
      <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-slate-200 hover:underline">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/termini/" class="hover:text-slate-200 hover:underline">Termini d'uso</a>
      <a href="/crediti/" class="hover:text-slate-200 hover:underline">Crediti e licenze</a>
    </nav>
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
